
# machine translated (Spanish), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Name of the Settings page about the ring, in the list and as its heading.
settings-ring-title = Anillo

# Words a person might type into the Settings search to find the ring page; separate them with spaces.
settings-ring-keywords = favoritos lanzador borde clic esquina activa voz habla ventanas abiertas portapapeles copiar pegar historial olvidar notificaciones

# Introduction under the heading of the ring page, and the words behind the page i.
settings-ring-help = Tus favoritos están alrededor del centro del anillo. Se eligen en el propio anillo: haz clic derecho en cualquier aplicación del anillo para añadirla o quitarla, y arrastra un favorito al lugar de otro para cambiar el orden.

# Sentence at the top of the ring page saying how the ring opens.
settings-ring-headline = El anillo se abre en el borde de la pantalla, y tus ventanas abiertas están en él.

# Name of the picture on the ring page that shows where things open.
settings-ring-picture = Dónde se abren las cosas

# Heading of the line saying the ring opens by clicking at the screen edge.
settings-ring-open-click = Haz clic en el borde de la pantalla

# Small words under that line about the Super key.
settings-ring-open-super = La tecla Super también lo abre.

# Line saying how many favourites the ring has; { $n } is the number.
settings-ring-favourites =
    { $n ->
        [one] { $n } favorito
        [many] { $n } favoritos
       *[other] { $n } favoritos
    }

# Small words under the favourites line.
settings-ring-favourites-about = Haz clic derecho en una aplicación del anillo para añadir una.

# Title of the card about opening the ring.
settings-ring-opening = Abrir el anillo

# Words behind the i of the card about opening the ring.
settings-ring-opening-about = Mueve el puntero al borde de la pantalla y haz clic, o pulsa la tecla Super, y el anillo se abre. Tus favoritos están alrededor del centro del anillo, y tus ventanas abiertas en un anillo a su alrededor: haz clic en una para traerla al frente, o clic derecho para ver sus botones. Haz clic derecho en cualquier aplicación del anillo para añadirla o quitarla.

# Heading of the switch line, and the spoken name of the switch, for showing notifications as they arrive.
settings-ring-notify-show = Mostrarlas al llegar

# Small words under the switch for showing notifications as they arrive.
settings-ring-notify-show-about = Desactivado: igualmente se reúnen en el anillo.

# Heading of the list line, and the name of the list, for how long a notification stays.
settings-ring-notify-long = Cuánto tiempo se quedan

# Small words under the list for how long notifications stay.
settings-ring-notify-long-about = Las urgentes esperan a que las cierres.

# Heading of the list line, and the name of the list, for which corner notifications appear in.
settings-ring-notify-where = Dónde aparecen

# Small words under the list for where notifications appear.
settings-ring-notify-where-about = La esquina desde la que se apilan hacia el lado contrario.

# Title of the card about notifications.
settings-ring-notify-title = Notificaciones

# Words behind the i of the card about notifications.
settings-ring-notify-about = Cuando un programa tiene algo que decirte, aparece unos segundos y se va. Si está desactivado, no aparece nada, y todo se sigue reuniendo en el círculo de notificaciones del anillo. Una urgente espera a que la cierres sea cual sea la opción elegida aquí, para que un aviso no desaparezca antes de leerse.

# Heading of the list line, and the name of the list, for when copied lines are forgotten.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-ring-clip-forget = Olvidar lo copiado

# Small words under the list for when copied lines are forgotten.
settings-ring-clip-forget-about = Las líneas fijadas se conservan.

# Heading of the line saying how many lines the clipboard holds now.
settings-ring-clip-now = Copiado ahora

# Small words under that line; { $n } is how many lines are kept and { $pinned } how many of them are pinned.
settings-ring-clip-count =
    { $n ->
        [one] { $n } línea, { $pinned } fijadas.
        [many] { $n } líneas, { $pinned } fijadas.
       *[other] { $n } líneas, { $pinned } fijadas.
    }

# Title of the card about the clipboard.
settings-ring-clip-title = Portapapeles

# Words behind the i of the card about the clipboard.
settings-ring-clip-about = El círculo del portapapeles del anillo guarda lo que copias, para que puedas pegar algo de antes. Las líneas fijadas se conservan siempre, sea cual sea la opción elegida aquí.

# Small words under the voice line while voice is being added.
settings-ring-voice-adding = Añadiendo la voz; sigue con lo tuyo mientras tanto.

# Small words under the voice line while its build tools are being removed.
settings-ring-voice-removing-tools = Eliminando las herramientas de compilación.

# Small words under the voice line while voice is being removed.
settings-ring-voice-removing = Eliminando la voz.

# Heading of the voice line, and the spoken name of its switch.
settings-ring-voice-control = Control por voz

# Said, in green, under the voice switch after voice is turned on.
settings-ring-voice-onoff-on = Activado

# Said, in green, under the voice switch after voice is turned off.
settings-ring-voice-onoff-off = Desactivado

# Small words under the voice switch.
settings-ring-voice-about = Se entiende solo en este equipo.

# Heading of the line, and the name of its button, that removes voice.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-ring-voice-remove = Eliminar la voz

# Small words under the line that removes voice.
settings-ring-voice-remove-about = Libera unos 150 MB.

# Words on the line offering to remove the build tools that stayed after voice was added.
settings-ring-voice-tools-left = Voz lista. Herramientas de compilación conservadas.

# Name of the button that removes the build tools voice left behind.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-ring-voice-tools-remove = Eliminar las herramientas de compilación

# Name of the button that adds voice control to the computer.
settings-ring-voice-add = Añadir control por voz (unos 150 MB)

# Small words under the voice line before voice is added.
settings-ring-voice-optional = Opcional; unos 150 MB para añadirlo.

# Title of the card about voice.
settings-ring-voice-title = Voz

# Words behind the i of the voice card; the quoted words are examples of what to say.
settings-ring-voice-card-about = Di el nombre de una aplicación, «más alto» o «ajustes de Wi-Fi» en lugar de hacer clic. Toca el centro del anillo y habla; deja de escuchar cuando tú lo haces. La voz se entiende en este equipo y no se envía nada a ninguna parte. Añadirla ocupa unos 150 MB y lleva unos minutos, y puedes seguir con lo tuyo mientras tanto; eliminarla quita el motor de voz y su modelo.

# Words beside the round progress dial while voice is being added.
settings-ring-voice-working-add = Añadiendo la voz

# Words beside the round progress dial while voice build tools are being removed.
settings-ring-voice-working-tools = Eliminando las herramientas de compilación

# Words beside the round progress dial while voice is being removed.
settings-ring-voice-working-remove = Eliminando la voz

# Choice in the list of when copied lines are forgotten: every time the computer restarts.
settings-ring-forget-reboot = Cada vez que se reinicia el equipo

# Choice in the list of when copied lines are forgotten: after a day.
settings-ring-forget-day = Después de un día

# Choice in the list of when copied lines are forgotten: after a week.
settings-ring-forget-week = Después de una semana

# Choice in the list of when copied lines are forgotten: after two weeks.
settings-ring-forget-fortnight = Después de dos semanas

# Choice in the list of when copied lines are forgotten: never.
settings-ring-forget-never = Nunca

# Heading of the switch line, and the spoken name of the switch, for showing a window's title under its picture when pointing at it in the ring.
settings-ring-names = Mostrar el título al señalar

# Small words under that switch.
settings-ring-names-about = Desactivado: solo la vista previa. Los lectores de pantalla siguen recibiendo el título.

